DESCRIPTION >
    - `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_ds` lists, for each month, the CNCF organizations active that month and the countries they are placed in: one row per month, organization and country.
    - Populated daily by `cncf_organization_countries_monthly_copy.pipe` from `cncf_collection_activities_ds` (full replace).
    - Serves `collection_contributors_geo_distribution_over_time.pipe`, which counts distinct organizations per country and period without scanning activities.
    - `month` is the first day of the month. Organizations whose place matches no country are left out.

TAGS "Report"

SCHEMA >
    `month` Date,
    `organizationId` String,
    `country` LowCardinality(String),
    `flag` LowCardinality(String),
    `country_code` LowCardinality(String)

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY month, country_code, organizationId
